# Sterling Keykeeper: "{2}, {T}: Tap target non-Mount creature." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and cannot activate it that turn (summoning sick,
# CR 302.6). On turn 3 it taps Bot2's Ornithopter (a non-Mount creature of either player is legal) paying {2} from two Moxen; Bot2's
# Brightfield Glider (a Mount) is refused as the target while the Ornithopter is accepted. The Keykeeper is itself tapped by the cost.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Sterling Keykeeper
Plains x2
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Brightfield Glider
Island x17

